#. type: Title =
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:1
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:11
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Independent Verification of IPsec Functionality in FreeBSD"
msgstr "FreeBSD 中 IPsec 功能的独立验证"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:43
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:46
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You installed IPsec and it seems to be working.  How do you know? I describe "
"a method for experimentally verifying that IPsec is working."
msgstr "您已安装 IPsec，而且它似乎可以正常工作。如何确认？本文介绍一种通过实验验证 IPsec 是否正常工作的方法。"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:48
msgid "'''"
msgstr "'''"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:52
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The Problem"
msgstr "问题"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First, lets assume you have crossref:ipsec-must[ipsec-install, Installing "
"IPsec].  How do you know it is crossref:ipsec-must[caveat, Caveat]? Sure, "
"your connection will not work if it is misconfigured, and it will work when "
"you finally get it right.  man:netstat[1] will list it. But can you "
"independently confirm it?"
msgstr "首先，假设您已经完成 crossref:ipsec-must[ipsec-install, 安装 IPsec]。如何确认它没有 crossref:ipsec-must[caveat, 隐患]？当然，如果配置错误，连接就无法工作；等您终于配置正确后，它就能工作了。man:netstat[1] 会列出它。但您能否独立确认这一点？"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:59
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The Solution"
msgstr "解决方案"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:62
#, fuzzy
msgid "First, some crypto-relevant info theory:"
msgstr "首先，介绍一些与密码学相关的信息论知识："

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Encrypted data is uniformly distributed, i.e., has maximal entropy per "
"symbol;"
msgstr "加密数据服从均匀分布，即每个符号具有最大熵；"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:65
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Raw, uncompressed data is typically redundant, i.e., has sub-maximal entropy."
msgstr "原始的未压缩数据通常存在冗余，即熵低于最大值。"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:69
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Suppose you could measure the entropy of the data to- and from- your network "
"interface.  Then you could see the difference between unencrypted data and "
"encrypted data.  This would be true even if some of the data in \"encrypted "
"mode\" was not encrypted---as the outermost IP header must be if the packet "
"is to be routable."
msgstr "假设您能够测量网络接口收发数据的熵，那么就能看出未加密数据和加密数据之间的差异。即使“加密模式”下的部分数据没有加密，这一点仍然成立——为了让数据包可路由，最外层的 IP 标头必须保持未加密。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:71
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "MUST"
msgstr "MUST"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ueli Maurer's \"Universal Statistical Test for Random Bit Generators"
"\"(https://web.archive.org/web/20011115002319/http://www.geocities.com/"
"SiliconValley/Code/4704/universal.pdf[MUST]) quickly measures the entropy of "
"a sample.  It uses a compression-like algorithm.  crossref:ipsec-must[code, "
"Maurer's Universal Statistical Test (for block size8 bits)] for a variant "
"which measures successive (~quarter megabyte) chunks of a file."
msgstr "Ueli Maurer 的“随机位生成器通用统计检验”（link:https://web.archive.org/web/20011115002319/http://www.geocities.com/SiliconValley/Code/4704/universal.pdf[MUST]）可以快速测量样本的熵。它使用一种类似压缩的算法。请参阅 crossref:ipsec-must[code, Maurer 通用统计检验（块大小为 8 位）]，其中的变体可以测量文件中连续的（约四分之一兆字节）数据块。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:78
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Tcpdump"
msgstr "Tcpdump"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:83
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We also need a way to capture the raw network data.  A program called man:"
"tcpdump[1] lets you do this, if you have enabled the _Berkeley Packet "
"Filter_ interface in your crossref:ipsec-must[kernel,src/sys/i386/conf/"
"KERNELNAME]."
msgstr "我们还需要一种捕获原始网络数据的方法。名为 man:tcpdump[1] 的程序可以完成这项工作，但您需要先在 crossref:ipsec-must[kernel,src/sys/i386/conf/KERNELNAME] 中启用 __Berkeley Packet Filter__ 接口。"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:85
#, fuzzy
msgid "The command:"
msgstr "命令如下："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:89
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid " tcpdump -c 4000 -s 10000 -w dumpfile.bin\n"
msgstr " tcpdump -c 4000 -s 10000 -w dumpfile.bin\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"will capture 4000 raw packets to _dumpfile.bin_.  Up to 10,000 bytes per "
"packet will be captured in this example."
msgstr "此命令会将 4000 个原始数据包捕获到 __dumpfile.bin__ 中。本例中，每个数据包最多捕获 10,000 字节。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:95
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The Experiment"
msgstr "实验"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:98
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is the experiment:"
msgstr "实验步骤如下："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:102
#, fuzzy
msgid "Open a window to an IPsec host and another window to an insecure host."
msgstr "打开一个窗口连接到使用 IPsec 的主机，再打开另一个窗口连接到不安全的主机。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:103
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now start crossref:ipsec-must[tcpdump, Tcpdump]."
msgstr "现在启动 crossref:ipsec-must[tcpdump, Tcpdump]。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:104
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the \"secure\" window, run the UNIX(R) command man:yes[1], which will "
"stream the `y` character. After a while, stop this. Switch to the insecure "
"window, and repeat. After a while, stop."
msgstr "在“安全”窗口中，运行 UNIX(R) 命令 man:yes[1]，它会持续输出字符 `y`。过一会儿将其停止。切换到不安全的窗口，重复此操作。过一会儿将其停止。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:105
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now run crossref:ipsec-must[code, Maurer's Universal Statistical Test (for "
"block size8 bits)] on the captured packets. You should see something like "
"the following. The important thing to note is that the secure connection has "
"93% (6.7) of the expected value (7.18), and the \"normal\" connection has "
"29% (2.1) of the expected value."
msgstr "现在对捕获的数据包运行 crossref:ipsec-must[code, Maurer 通用统计检验（块大小为 8 位）]。您应该会看到类似以下的结果。请注意，安全连接的结果达到预期值（7.18）的 93%（6.7），而“普通”连接的结果仅为预期值的 29%（2.1）。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:121
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"% tcpdump -c 4000 -s 10000 -w ipsecdemo.bin\n"
"% uliscan ipsecdemo.bin\n"
"Uliscan 21 Dec 98\n"
"L=8 256 258560\n"
"Measuring file ipsecdemo.bin\n"
"Init done\n"
"Expected value for L=8 is 7.1836656\n"
"6.9396 --------------------------------------------------------\n"
"6.6177 -----------------------------------------------------\n"
"6.4100 ---------------------------------------------------\n"
"2.1101 -----------------\n"
"2.0838 -----------------\n"
"2.0983 -----------------\n"
msgstr "% tcpdump -c 4000 -s 10000 -w ipsecdemo.bin\n% uliscan ipsecdemo.bin\nUliscan 21 Dec 98\nL=8 256 258560\nMeasuring file ipsecdemo.bin\nInit done\nExpected value for L=8 is 7.1836656\n6.9396 --------------------------------------------------------\n6.6177 -----------------------------------------------------\n6.4100 ---------------------------------------------------\n2.1101 -----------------\n2.0838 -----------------\n2.0983 -----------------\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:125
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Caveat"
msgstr "注意事项"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This experiment shows that IPsec _does_ seem to be distributing the payload "
"data __uniformly__, as encryption should.  However, the experiment described "
"here _cannot_ detect many possible flaws in a system (none of which do I "
"have any evidence for).  These include poor key generation or exchange, data "
"or keys being visible to others, use of weak algorithms, kernel subversion, "
"etc.  Study the source; know the code."
msgstr "该实验表明，IPsec 似乎确实按照加密应有的方式，使有效载荷数据呈 __uniformly__ 分布。不过，本文所述实验无法检测系统中许多可能存在的缺陷（我没有证据表明存在这些缺陷）。其中包括密钥生成或交换不可靠、数据或密钥可能被他人看到、使用弱算法、内核被篡改等。请研究源代码，了解代码。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:133
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "IPsec---Definition"
msgstr "IPsec——定义"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:139
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Internet Protocol security extensions to IPv4; required for IPv6.  A "
"protocol for negotiating encryption and authentication at the IP (host-to-"
"host) level.  SSL secures only one application socket; SSH secures only a "
"login; PGP secures only a specified file or message.  IPsec encrypts "
"everything between two hosts."
msgstr "IPv4 的互联网协议安全扩展；IPv6 必需。用于在 IP（主机到主机）层协商加密和身份验证的协议。SSL 只保护一个应用程序套接字；SSH 只保护一次登录；PGP 只保护指定的文件或消息。IPsec 会加密两台主机之间的所有内容。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:141
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Installing IPsec"
msgstr "安装 IPsec"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:145
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Most of the modern versions of FreeBSD have IPsec support in their base "
"source.  So you will need to include the `IPSEC` option in your kernel "
"config and, after kernel rebuild and reinstall, configure IPsec connections "
"using man:setkey[8] command."
msgstr "大多数现代版本的 FreeBSD 都在其基础源代码中支持 IPsec。因此，您需要在内核配置中加入 `IPSEC` 选项；重建并重新安装内核后，使用 man:setkey[8] 命令配置 IPsec 连接。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/articles/ipsec-must/_index.adoc:147
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A comprehensive guide on running IPsec on FreeBSD is provided in extref:{vpn-"
"ipsec}[VPN over IPsec]."
msgstr "extref:{vpn-ipsec}[通过 IPsec 使用 VPN] 提供了在 FreeBSD 上运行 IPsec 的完整指南。"

